---
/**
 * Deliberately one tight beat, not a wall of motivational copy.
 * copy-guidelines.md: direct, physical, unhyped. Never shame the user.
 */
---

<section class="section problem" aria-labelledby="problem-heading">
  <div class="container problem-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>The gap</p>
    <h2 id="problem-heading" class="t-display problem-line" data-reveal>
      you already know what to do.<br />
      <span class="muted">quitting just doesn't cost you anything.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="t-subhead problem-sub" data-reveal>
      Skipping a session is free, so it happens. Lockd puts a small, real price on it —
      one you set yourself, and one you get back the moment you follow through.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem {
    padding-block: var(--space-9);
  }

  .problem-inner {
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  .problem-line {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .muted {
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .problem-sub {
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }
</style>
